OL,3,GNEWSASchool pupils play mass Simon Says
OL,4,Agame for charity
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of schoolchildren across
OL,7,FHampshire are taking part in a game of
OL,8,FSimon Says to support a bereavement
OL,9,Fcharity.
OL,11,FMore than 40 schools have signed up for
OL,12,Fthe event in classrooms later.
OL,14,FIt is being held to mark the 25th
OL,15,Fanniversary of Romsey charity Simon
OL,16,FSays, which supports bereaved children
OL,17,Fand young people.
OL,19,FCaroline, from Portchester, said the
OL,20,Fcharity helped to make happy memories
OL,21,Ffor her daughter Valentina, whose
OL,22,Fsister Emilia died in 2020.
